  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Air Quality Cooperation with Georgia: Preparatory Phase</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Luftkvalitetssamarbete med Georgien: f&#xf6;rberedande fas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r en f&#xf6;rberedande fas f&#xf6;r SwEPA f&#xf6;r att ytterligare utforska m&#xf6;jligheterna till ett institutionellt samarbete med Environment Protection and Agriculture och National Environmental Agency om f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring och f&#xf6;rvaltning av luftkvaliteten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Project is a preparatory phase of SwEPA to further explore the possibilities for an institutional cooperation with the Ministry of Environment Protection and Agriculture and the National Environmental Agency of the management and improvement of the air quality sector in Georgia.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the preparatory phase with the Swedish Environment Protection Agency is to further explore the possibilities for a future, institutional cooperation with the Georgian Ministry of Environmental Protection and Agriculture and the National Environmental Agency regarding the  technical management of and improvement of air quality in Georgia.</narrative>
  </description>
